f s-bottom-padding-half background-image" style="background-repeat:no-repeat;background-size:cover;background-color:transparent;background-position:50% 50%;background-image:url(https://img.youtube.com/vi/DVvZCSS77aI/maxresdefault.jpg)" data-bg="https://img.youtube.com/vi/DVvZCSS77aI/maxresdefault.jpg" data-react-style="{&quot;backgroundRepeat&quot;:&quot;no-repeat&quot;,&quot;backgroundSize&quot;:&quot;cover&quot;,&quot;backgroundColor&quot;:&quot;transparent&quot;,&quot;backgroundPosition&quot;:&quot;50% 50%&quot;}"><div class="blurred-layer css-1tnf9eu css-19g8d280"></div><div class="waypoint"></div><div class="container"><div class="columns sixteen"><div class="s-title-group"><div class="s-title-beta-s6 s-title"><div class="s-component s-text   "><div class=""><div class="s-component-content s-font-title" style="white-space:pre-wrap"><div class="s-rich-text-wrapper" style="display: block; "><h1 class=" s-text-color-default s-rich-text-wrapper font-size-tag-header-one s-text-font-size-over-40" style="font-size: 48px;"><span class="s-text-color-default">康 明 生 活</span></h1></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="s-ecommerce-container"><div class="s-component s-ecommerce "><div class="s-ecommerce-content"><div class="s-ecommerce-products-wrapper "><div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-wrapper" style="left:0"><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-cards-wrapper"><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-cards" style="height:auto"><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card third columns no-float  mobile-two-column"><a class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-link" href="/portfolio/items/45" style="color:inherit"><div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-image landscape in-stock"><div class="s-img-wrapper"><img alt="product image" class="lazyload " src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_1/26328510/263735_216943.png" data-src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_auto/26328510/263735_216943.png"/></div></div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-description"><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-name s-font-body ">一生坦坦蕩蕩做人 餘生清清白白做事 我們勇敢無懼的站出來 我們不做政黨的橡皮圖章 我們只對45萬的市民負責</div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-price-wrapper  "></div></div></div></a></div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card third columns no-float  mobile-two-column"><a class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-link" href="/portfolio/items/196997c28dd" style="color:inherit"><div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-image landscape in-stock"><div class="s-img-wrapper"><img alt="product image" class="lazyload " src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_1/26328510/184217_181998.png" data-src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_auto/26328510/184217_181998.png"/></div></div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-description"><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-name s-font-body ">今早 在這裡 好多車啊</div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-price-wrapper  "></div></div></div></a></div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card third columns no-float  mobile-two-column"><a class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-link" href="/portfolio/items/503bae2ce5c" style="color:inherit"><div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-image landscape in-stock"><div class="s-img-wrapper"><img alt="product image" class="lazyload " src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_1/26328510/25041_1342.jpeg" data-src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_auto/26328510/25041_1342.jpeg"/></div></div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-description"><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-name s-font-body ">早上第三個點 ~天公壇 幫 何志勇 市長候選人 ~發面紙 一路相挺到底！</div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-price-wrapper  "></div></div></div></a></div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card third columns no-float  mobile-two-column"><a class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-link" href="/portfolio/items/3020d34dba3" style="color:inherit"><div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-image landscape in-stock"><div class="s-img-wrapper"><img alt="product image" class="lazyload " src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_1/26328510/859449_553757.png" data-src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_auto/26328510/859449_553757.png"/></div></div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-description"><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-name s-font-body ">早安！新竹！ 週日快樂！ 我在十八尖山！</div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-price-wrapper  "></div></div></div></a></div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card third columns no-float  mobile-two-column"><a class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-link" href="/portfolio/items/600" style="color:inherit"><div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-image landscape in-stock"><div class="s-img-wrapper"><img alt="product image" class="lazyload " src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_1/26328510/132791_105808.png" data-src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_auto/26328510/132791_105808.png"/></div></div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-description"><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-name s-font-body ">唯一的一張手舉板 造價近600元 謝謝東區市議員候選人 陳珍裕 協助製作完成 放上了關公形象 提醒自己在這場選戰裡 要驍勇善戰且崇尚忠義</div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-price-wrapper  "></div></div></div></a></div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card third columns no-float  mobile-two-column"><a class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-link" href="/portfolio/items/0fb3a5495ee" style="color:inherit"><div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-image landscape in-stock"><div class="s-img-wrapper"><img alt="product image" class="lazyload " src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_1/26328510/30773_935797.png" data-src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_auto/26328510/30773_935797.png"/></div></div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-description"><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-name s-font-body ">遭高虹安市府官員放話「政治處理」錢康明發不自殺聲明並報警</div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-price-wrapper  "></div></div></div></a></div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card third columns no-float  mobile-two-column"><a class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-link" href="/portfolio/items/10-8-7-00" style="color:inherit"><div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-image landscape in-stock"><div class="s-img-wrapper"><img alt="product image" class="lazyload " src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_1/26328510/367807_742990.png" data-src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_auto/26328510/367807_742990.png"/></div></div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-description"><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-name s-font-body ">10/8（四）早上7：00 第一次到光復路、關新路口 超多車~~~</div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-price-wrapper  "></div></div></div></a></div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card third columns no-float  mobile-two-column"><a class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-link" href="/portfolio/items/5-00-2" style="color:inherit"><div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-image landscape in-stock"><div class="s-img-wrapper"><img alt="product image" class="lazyload " src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_1/26328510/713012_763640.jpeg" data-src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_auto/26328510/713012_763640.jpeg"/></div></div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-description"><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-name s-font-body ">早上5：00 新竹市果菜市場 先拜訪2樓的水果批發</div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-price-wrapper  "></div></div></div></a></div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card third columns no-float  mobile-two-column"><a class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-link" href="/portfolio/items/7-00" style="color:inherit"><div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-image landscape in-stock"><div class="s-img-wrapper"><img alt="product image" class="lazyload " src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_1/26328510/104457_26063.jpeg" data-src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_auto/26328510/104457_26063.jpeg"/></div></div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-description"><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-name s-font-body ">早上7：00站經國路、民主路街口 一位市民走到我身旁 他嚴肅的告訴我： 「你一定要加油，你是新竹最後的良知。」</div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-price-wrapper  "></div></div></div></a></div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card third columns no-float  mobile-two-column"><a class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-link" href="/portfolio/items/9-29-10-4-7-00" style="color:inherit"><div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-image landscape in-stock"><div class="s-img-wrapper"><img alt="product image" class="lazyload " src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_1/26328510/543412_584407.jpeg" data-src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_auto/26328510/543412_584407.jpeg"/></div></div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-description"><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-name s-font-body ">今天起 9/29（二）~10/4（日） 每天早上7：00 我和何志勇市長候選人 在大菜市場路口和大家說早安 選賢與能 讓好人出頭</div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-price-wrapper  "></div></div></div></a></div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card third columns no-float  mobile-two-column"><a class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-link" href="/portfolio/items/9a445963b32" style="color:inherit"><div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-image landscape in-stock"><div class="s-img-wrapper"><img alt="product image" class="lazyload " src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_1/26328510/503967_543949.jpeg" data-src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_auto/26328510/503967_543949.jpeg"/></div></div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-description"><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-name s-font-body ">連假最後一天 和光復中學小學弟陳珍裕 （東區市議員候選人） 十八尖山走起來</div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-price-wrapper  "></div></div></div></a></div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card third columns no-float  mobile-two-column"><a class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-link" href="/portfolio/items/77d1e012f61" style="color:inherit"><div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-image landscape in-stock"><div class="s-img-wrapper"><img alt="product image" class="lazyload " src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_1/26328510/85683_802752.jpeg" data-src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_auto/26328510/85683_802752.jpeg"/></div></div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-description"><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-name s-font-body ">今天參加孫宗孝競選總部成立，現場是西區場，幾乎沒有我所在的東區選民。我之所以跨區站台，源自當年我和這名年輕人的故事。</div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-price-wrapper  "></div></div></div></a></div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card third columns no-float  mobile-two-column"><a class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-link" href="/portfolio/items/0ae64c4e9ba" style="color:inherit"><div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-image landscape in-stock"><div class="s-img-wrapper"><img alt="product image" class="lazyload " src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_1/26328510/748015_79708.jpeg" data-src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_auto/26328510/748015_79708.jpeg"/></div></div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-description"><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-name s-font-body ">一大早 前往開臺金山寺 參加祈福遶境活動 遇到一大群好朋友 大家都為新竹市努力中</div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-price-wrapper  "></div></div></div></a></div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card third columns no-float  mobile-two-column"><a class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-link" href="/portfolio/items/10-00" style="color:inherit"><div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-image landscape in-stock"><div class="s-img-wrapper"><img alt="product image" class="lazyload " src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_1/26328510/324138_71276.jpeg" data-src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_auto/26328510/324138_71276.jpeg"/></div></div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-description"><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-name s-font-body ">一家一家拜票講話 根本沒機會吃烤肉  中秋節的第一餐 是晚上10：00吃麥當勞</div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-price-wrapper  "></div></div></div></a></div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card third columns no-float  mobile-two-column"><a class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-link" href="/portfolio/items/7-30-0d607730-09f7-4257-b7d9-2512a9772444" style="color:inherit"><div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-image landscape in-stock"><div class="s-img-wrapper"><img alt="product image" class="lazyload " src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_1/26328510/595360_641728.jpeg" data-src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_auto/26328510/595360_641728.jpeg"/></div></div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-description"><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-name s-font-body ">早上7：30大菜市場站路口 我喜歡大菜市場 因為這裡很擠 適合從小就愛熱鬧的我</div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-price-wrapper  "></div></div></div></a></div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card third columns no-float  mobile-two-column"><a class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-link" href="/portfolio/items/f2277b5578f" style="color:inherit"><div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-image landscape in-stock"><div class="s-img-wrapper"><img alt="product image" class="lazyload " src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_1/26328510/101162_919436.png" data-src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_auto/26328510/101162_919436.png"/></div></div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-description"><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-name s-font-body ">願月光溫柔照拂每一個家庭，祝大家月圓人平安，事事順遂。  誠實、清廉、真監督！ 新竹值得更好，新竹加油！</div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-price-wrapper  "></div></div></div></a></div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card third columns no-float  mobile-two-column"><a class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-link" href="/portfolio/items/4f0c74500ed" style="color:inherit"><div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-image landscape in-stock"><div class="s-img-wrapper"><img alt="product image" class="lazyload " src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_1/26328510/788340_830981.jpeg" data-src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_auto/26328510/788340_830981.jpeg"/></div></div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-description"><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-name s-font-body ">回台中參加教會弟兄的追思會 沒有排場、沒有鮮花  用詩歌和回憶訴說著滿滿的思念</div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-price-wrapper  "></div></div></div></a></div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card third columns no-float  mobile-two-column"><a class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-link" href="/portfolio/items/9-17-7-30" style="color:inherit"><div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-image landscape in-stock"><div class="s-img-wrapper"><img alt="product image" class="lazyload " src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_1/26328510/246718_525882.jpeg" data-src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_auto/26328510/246718_525882.jpeg"/></div></div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-description"><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-name s-font-body ">9/17（四）早上7：30 大菜市場站路口 我用手板幫何志勇市長候選人遮太陽 選舉的路上相互支持</div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-price-wrapper  "></div></div></div></a></div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card third columns no-float  mobile-two-column"><a class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-link" href="/portfolio/items/115" style="color:inherit"><div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-image landscape in-stock"><div class="s-img-wrapper"><img alt="product image" class="lazyload " src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_1/26328510/857749_378245.jpg" data-src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_auto/26328510/857749_378245.jpg"/></div></div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-description"><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-name s-font-body ">錢康明議員候選人與何志勇市長候選人，一起參加115年度樹下柚見中秋登社會福利宣導活動</div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-price-wrapper  "></div></div></div></a></div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card third columns no-float  mobile-two-column"><a class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-link" href="/portfolio/items/3" style="color:inherit"><div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-image landscape in-stock"><div class="s-img-wrapper"><img alt="product image" class="lazyload " src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_1/26328510/854736_29133.jpeg" data-src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_auto/26328510/854736_29133.jpeg"/></div></div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-description"><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-name s-font-body ">竹市長是3博士選舉 錢康明：不論高虹安是否當選、國民黨都將是輸家</div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-price-wrapper  "></div></div></div></a></div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card third columns no-float  mobile-two-column"><div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-image landscape in-stock"><div class="s-img-wrapper"><img alt="product image" class="lazyload " src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_1/26328510/663423_448363.jpeg" data-src="https://custom-images.strikinglycdn.com/res/hrscywv4p/image/upload/c_limit,fl_lossy,h_1000,w_500,f_auto,q_auto/26328510/663423_448363.jpeg"/></div></div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-description"><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-name s-font-body ">在竹蓮市場掃街特別辛苦 因為越掃越餓 一直跟攤商說：「等我結束就來買。」</div><div class="s-ecommerce-card-view-card-price-wrapper  "></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="sixteen columns s-ecommerce-pagination left-alignment has-custom-align"><style data-emotion="css 11x3gmf">.css-11x3gmf .s-common-button{border-radius:1000px;border:1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);background:#35858e;color:#fff;-webkit-transition:all 0.15s;transition:all 0.15s;-webkit-background-clip:padding-box;background-clip:padding-box;}.css-11x3gmf .s-common-button:hover{opacity:1;background:#3f9faa;}.s-section.s-bg-ligh